*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "0.1.0"
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*LanguageVersion: English
*Manufacturer: "Brother"
*PCFileName: "SISTER2030.PPD"
*Product: "(Brother HL-2030 series)"
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:Brother;MDL:HL-2030 series"
*cupsVersion: 2.0
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsModelNumber: 3
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 /Library/Printers/SisterHL2030/filter/rastertosisterhl2030"
*PSVersion: "(3010.106) 3"
*ModelName: "HL-2030 series"
*NickName: "Brother HL-2030 series (SisterHL2030)"
*ShortNickName: "HL-2030 SisterHL2030"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "18"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42

*OpenUI *PageSize: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Executive/Executive: "<</PageSize[522 756]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A5/A5: "<</PageSize[420 595]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A6/A6: "<</PageSize[297 420]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Env10/Com-10: "<</PageSize[297 684]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize EnvMonarch/Monarch: "<</PageSize[279 540]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize EnvDL/DL: "<</PageSize[312 624]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize EnvC5/C5: "<</PageSize[459 649]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 40 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Executive/Executive: "<</PageSize[522 756]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A5/A5: "<</PageSize[420 595]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A6/A6: "<</PageSize[297 420]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Env10/Com-10: "<</PageSize[297 684]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion EnvMonarch/Monarch: "<</PageSize[279 540]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion EnvDL/DL: "<</PageSize[312 624]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion EnvC5/C5: "<</PageSize[459 649]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*% Full-page ImageableArea so macOS does not Scale-to-Fit (~96% on A4).
*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea Letter/US Letter: "0 0 612 792"
*ImageableArea Legal/US Legal: "0 0 612 1008"
*ImageableArea Executive/Executive: "0 0 522 756"
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "0 0 595 842"
*ImageableArea A5/A5: "0 0 420 595"
*ImageableArea A6/A6: "0 0 297 420"
*ImageableArea Env10/Com-10: "0 0 297 684"
*ImageableArea EnvMonarch/Monarch: "0 0 279 540"
*ImageableArea EnvDL/DL: "0 0 312 624"
*ImageableArea EnvC5/C5: "0 0 459 649"

*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension Letter/US Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension Legal/US Legal: "612 1008"
*PaperDimension Executive/Executive: "522 756"
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595 842"
*PaperDimension A5/A5: "420 595"
*PaperDimension A6/A6: "297 420"
*PaperDimension Env10/Com-10: "297 684"
*PaperDimension EnvMonarch/Monarch: "279 540"
*PaperDimension EnvDL/DL: "312 624"
*PaperDimension EnvC5/C5: "459 649"

*OpenUI *BRMediaType/Media Type: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 28 AnySetup *BRMediaType
*DefaultBRMediaType: Plain
*BRMediaType Plain/Plain Paper: "<</MediaType(Plain)/cupsMediaType 1>>setpagedevice"
*BRMediaType Thin/Thin Paper: "<</MediaType(Thin)/cupsMediaType 2>>setpagedevice"
*BRMediaType Thick/Thick Paper: "<</MediaType(Thick)/cupsMediaType 3>>setpagedevice"
*BRMediaType ThickPaper2/Thicker Paper: "<</MediaType(ThickPaper2)/cupsMediaType 4>>setpagedevice"
*BRMediaType Transparency/Transparencies: "<</MediaType(Transparency)/cupsMediaType 6>>setpagedevice"
*BRMediaType Env/Envelopes: "<</MediaType(Env)/cupsMediaType 7>>setpagedevice"
*BRMediaType EnvThick/Env. Thick: "<</MediaType(EnvThick)/cupsMediaType 8>>setpagedevice"
*BRMediaType EnvThin/Env. Thin: "<</MediaType(EnvThin)/cupsMediaType 9>>setpagedevice"
*BRMediaType Recycled/Recycled Paper: "<</MediaType(Recycled)/cupsMediaType 10>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *BRMediaType

*OpenUI *InputSlot/Media Source: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 29 AnySetup *InputSlot
*DefaultInputSlot: Tray1
*InputSlot Tray1/Tray 1: "<</MediaPosition 1/ManualFeed false>>setpagedevice"
*InputSlot Manual/Manual Feed: "<</MediaPosition 5/ManualFeed true>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *InputSlot

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 11 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*Resolution 300dpi/300 dpi: "<</HWResolution[300 300]/cupsColorSpace 3/cupsBitsPerColor 8>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 600dpi/600 dpi: "<</HWResolution[600 600]/cupsColorSpace 3/cupsBitsPerColor 8>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 1200dpi/HQ 1200: "<</HWResolution[1200 1200]/cupsColorSpace 3/cupsBitsPerColor 8>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*% Toner save is not a checkbox: Rascunho and Normal set ECONOMODE;
*% Alta (HQ1200) leaves it off.

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(002.004S)" Standard ROM
*Font Courier-Bold: Standard "(002.004S)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica: Standard "(001.006S)" Standard ROM
*Font Times-Roman: Standard "(001.007S)" Standard ROM
*Font Symbol: Special "(001.007S)" Special ROM
